Verse 1:
[Eb]A[Bb]bide with [Cm]me; [Eb]fast [Ab]falls [Bb]the [Cm7]e [Bb7]ven[Eb]tide;
[Eb]The [Ab]dark[Eb]ness [Ab]deep[Eb]ens; [Fm7]Lord, [Bb]with [Eb]me [F7]a[Bb]bide!
[Eb]When [Bb]other [Cm]help[Eb]ers [Ab]fail, and [C7]comforts [Fm]flee,
[Bb7]Help [Eb]of [Bb7]the [Eb]help[Bb7]less, [Cm]O[Fm]a[Eb]bide [Bb7]with [Eb]me!

Verse 2:
[Eb]Swift [Bb]to [Cm]its [Eb]close [Ab]ebbs [Bb]out [Cm7]life's [Bb7]little [Eb]day;
[Eb][Ab]Earth's [Eb]joys [Ab]grow [Eb]dim; [Fm7][Bb]its [Eb]glories [F7]pass [Bb]away;
[Eb]Change [Bb]and [Cm]decay [Eb]in [Ab]all [C7]around [Fm]I see;
[Bb7][Eb]O [Bb7]Thou [Eb]who [Bb7]changest [Cm][Fm]not, [Eb]abide [Bb7]with [Eb]me.

Verse 3:
[Eb][Bb]I [Cm]need [Eb]Thy [Ab][Bb]presence [Cm7]every [Bb7]passing [Eb]hour.
[Eb][Ab]What [Eb]but [Ab]Thy [Eb]grace [Fm7]can [Bb]foil [Eb]the [F7]tempter's [Bb]power?
[Eb]Who, [Bb]like [Cm]Thyself, [Eb]my guide [Ab]and [C7]stay [Fm]can be?
[Bb7][Eb]Through [Bb7]cloud [Eb]and [Bb7]sunshine, [Cm][Fm]Lord, [Eb]abide [Bb7]with [Eb]me.

Verse 4:
[Eb]I [Bb]fear [Cm]no [Eb]foe, [Ab]with [Bb]Thee [Cm7]at [Bb7]hand [Eb]to bless;
[Eb][Ab]Ills [Eb]have [Ab]no [Eb]weight, [Fm7][Bb]and [Eb]tears [F7]no [Bb]bitterness.
[Eb]Where [Bb]is [Cm]death's [Eb]sting? [Ab]Where, [C7]grave, [Fm]thy victory?
[Bb7][Eb]I [Bb7]triumph [Eb]still, [Bb7]if [Cm][Fm]Thou [Eb]abide [Bb7]with [Eb]me!
